OL,3,GNEWSARoyals roll out red carpet for
OL,4,Avisiting Sultan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham will join
OL,7,Fthe Omani visitors at a spectacular
OL,8,Fstate banquet on Tuesday evening, ahead
OL,9,Fof political discussions at Downing
OL,10,FStreet on Wednesday.
